<title>POLAND: LUBAWA MARCH NET RISES TO PLN 0.4.</title>
<headline>LUBAWA MARCH NET RISES TO PLN 0.4.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results March</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>MARCH</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.40 vs   0.14</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.73 vs   0.25</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.12 vs   0.31</p>
<p> Sales		    2.61 vs   2.97</p>
<p>JANUARY-MARCH</p>
<p> Net profit	     1.00 vs   0.29</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 1.60 vs   0.50</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.20 vs   0.59</p>
<p> Sales		    6.22 vs   7.36</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish technical clothing maker is</p>
<p>Zaklady Konfekcji Technicznej Lubawa SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
